//! Differential ratchet for
//! `src/engine/battleScriptConfuseifrepeatingattackendsOpcode.ts`. Expected
//! complete projected results, controls, and the exact custom missing-role
//! error are generated by executing the canonical TypeScript opcode handler;
//! regenerate with `node --experimental-strip-types
//! core-rs/tools/gen-battle-script-confuseifrepeatingattackends-vectors.mjs`.

